    <string name="background_zenlock_needs_access_to_usage_statistics_to_show_you_how_much_screen_time_y">ZenLock needs access to usage statistics to show you how much screen time you\'re saving. This permission allows the app to see which apps you use and for how long, but this data stays private on your device and is only used to calculate your focus statistics.</string>
    <string name="background_to_enable_screen_time_tracking_1_tap_grant_permission_below_2_find_zenlock">To enable screen time tracking:\n\n1. Tap \'Grant Permission\' below\n2. Find \'ZenLock\' in the list\n3. Toggle \'Permit usage access\' ON\n4. Return to the app\n\nThis helps ZenLock show you accurate focus statistics and time saved.</string>
